  "description": "MEJGIU crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C62 H60 Er4 N8 O22. From the CIF bond table, Er1 (Er) has 7 O neighbors; Er2 (Er) has 7 O neighbors; Er1B (Er) has 7 O neighbors; Er2B (Er) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.433-3.843 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 93.90-112.38°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C62H60Er4N8O22. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 2 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
